# Whitelist: tudo ignorado por padrão, só os scripts e o manual entram.
# Nada de ipsw, discos, tickets, chaves ou firmware — o guia da ChefKiss
# proíbe compartilhar qualquer um deles.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!inferno.sh
!run-iphone.sh
!run-companion.sh
!patch-fs.sh
!wait-and-restore.sh
!companion/
companion/*
!companion/seed/
companion/seed/*
!companion/seed/user-data
!companion/seed/meta-data
